Source: nettle
Section: community/libs
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Maxwell <maxwell@blueberrypieos.com>
Build-Depends: pietoolchain-host (>= 0.3.0), pietoolchain-sdk (>= 0.2.0), autoconf (>= 2.70), libgmp-dev (>= 6.3.0)
Standards-Version: 4.7.3
Homepage: https://www.lysator.liu.se/~nisse/nettle/
Vcs-Git: https://github.com/blueberrypieos/nettle.git -b blueberry-pie-os/latest
Vcs-Browser: https://github.com/blueberrypieos/nettle
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: libnettle
Architecture: darwin-arm64
Depends: libsystem
Description: low-level cryptographic library
 Nettle provides symmetric ciphers, cryptographic hash functions,
 message authentication codes and key derivation functions.
 The Serpent ciphers and the knuth-lfib generator are left out.

Package: libhogweed
Architecture: darwin-arm64
Depends: libnettle (= ${binary:Version}), libgmp (>= 6.3.0), libsystem
Description: public-key cryptographic library
 Hogweed provides public-key cryptographic algorithms using Nettle
 and multiple-precision arithmetic from GMP.

Package: nettle-dev
Section: community/libdevel
Architecture: darwin-arm64
Depends: libnettle (= ${binary:Version}), libhogweed (= ${binary:Version}), libgmp-dev (>= 6.3.0)
Description: cryptographic libraries: development files
 Headers, shared library links and pkg-config files for building
 programs against Nettle and Hogweed. There is no serpent.h or
 knuth-lfib.h.
